sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant FE as Frontend (Next.js)
    participant API as Backend API (FastAPI)
    participant Auth as AuthService
    participant DocCtrl as DocumentController
    participant DocProc as DocumentProcessor
    participant TaskQ as TaskQueue
    participant Worker as Celery Worker
    participant AI as AIService
    participant DB as Database
    participant Storage as Object Storage (S3/Azure)
    participant TempProc as TemplateProcessor
    
    %% Upload and Analysis of Legal Petition Flow
    Client->>FE: Upload Petition PDF
    FE->>API: POST /api/documents/upload
    API->>Auth: Verify user token
    Auth-->>API: User authenticated
    API->>DocCtrl: upload_document(file, user_id)
    DocCtrl->>Storage: Store PDF file
    Storage-->>DocCtrl: Return file_path
    DocCtrl->>DB: Create Document record
    DB-->>DocCtrl: Return Document
    DocCtrl-->>API: Return Document metadata
    API-->>FE: Return Document ID and status
    FE-->>Client: Display upload success
    
    Client->>FE: Request document analysis
    FE->>API: POST /api/analyses/create
    API->>Auth: Verify user token
    Auth-->>API: User authenticated
    API->>DocCtrl: get_document(doc_id, user_id)
    DocCtrl->>DB: Query Document
    DB-->>DocCtrl: Return Document
    API->>TaskQ: Enqueue analysis task
    TaskQ->>DB: Create Task record (PENDING)
    DB-->>TaskQ: Return Task
    TaskQ-->>API: Return Task ID
    API-->>FE: Return Task ID and status
    FE-->>Client: Display analysis in progress
    
    TaskQ->>Worker: Delegate analysis task
    Worker->>Storage: Get document file
    Storage-->>Worker: Return PDF file
    Worker->>DocProc: process_pdf(file_path)
    DocProc->>DocProc: Check if OCR needed
    alt OCR required
        DocProc->>DocProc: apply_ocr(file_path)
    end
    DocProc-->>Worker: Return extracted text
    Worker->>DocProc: chunk_document(text)
    DocProc-->>Worker: Return text chunks
    Worker->>AI: analyze_petition(text_chunks)
    AI-->>Worker: Return analysis results
    Worker->>DB: Create Analysis record
    DB-->>Worker: Return Analysis
    Worker->>TaskQ: Update task (COMPLETED)
    TaskQ->>DB: Update Task record
    
    Client->>FE: Poll for task status
    FE->>API: GET /api/tasks/{task_id}
    API->>TaskQ: get_task_status(task_id)
    TaskQ->>DB: Query Task
    DB-->>TaskQ: Return Task
    TaskQ-->>API: Return Task status
    API-->>FE: Return Task status (COMPLETED)
    FE->>API: GET /api/analyses/{analysis_id}
    API->>DB: Query Analysis
    DB-->>API: Return Analysis
    API-->>FE: Return Analysis data
    FE-->>Client: Display petition analysis results
    
    %% Document Generation Flow
    Client->>FE: Select template for defense
    FE->>API: GET /api/templates
    API->>Auth: Verify user token
    Auth-->>API: User authenticated
    API->>DB: Query Templates
    DB-->>API: Return Templates
    API-->>FE: Return available templates
    FE-->>Client: Display template options
    
    Client->>FE: Upload custom template (optional)
    FE->>API: POST /api/templates/upload
    API->>Auth: Verify user token
    Auth-->>API: User authenticated
    API->>Storage: Store template file
    Storage-->>API: Return file_path
    API->>TempProc: parse_template(file_path)
    TempProc->>TempProc: extract_placeholders(content)
    TempProc-->>API: Return placeholders
    API->>DB: Create Template record
    DB-->>API: Return Template
    API-->>FE: Return Template metadata
    FE-->>Client: Display upload success
    
    Client->>FE: Request defense generation
    FE->>API: POST /api/documents/generate
    API->>Auth: Verify user token
    Auth-->>API: User authenticated
    API->>TaskQ: Enqueue generation task
    TaskQ->>DB: Create Task record (PENDING)
    DB-->>TaskQ: Return Task
    TaskQ-->>API: Return Task ID
    API-->>FE: Return Task ID and status
    FE-->>Client: Display generation in progress
    
    TaskQ->>Worker: Delegate generation task
    Worker->>DB: Get Template and Analysis
    DB-->>Worker: Return Template and Analysis
    Worker->>Storage: Get template file
    Storage-->>Worker: Return DOCX template
    Worker->>TempProc: parse_template(template_path)
    TempProc-->>Worker: Return template structure
    Worker->>AI: generate_defense_content(analysis, template_info)
    AI-->>Worker: Return content for placeholders
    Worker->>TempProc: fill_template(template_path, data)
    TempProc-->>Worker: Return filled document
    Worker->>Storage: Save generated document
    Storage-->>Worker: Return file_path
    Worker->>DB: Create GeneratedDocument record
    DB-->>Worker: Return GeneratedDocument
    Worker->>TaskQ: Update task (COMPLETED)
    TaskQ->>DB: Update Task record
    
    Client->>FE: Poll for task status
    FE->>API: GET /api/tasks/{task_id}
    API->>TaskQ: get_task_status(task_id)
    TaskQ->>DB: Query Task
    DB-->>TaskQ: Return Task
    TaskQ-->>API: Return Task status
    API-->>FE: Return Task status (COMPLETED)
    FE->>API: GET /api/documents/generated/{doc_id}
    API->>DB: Query GeneratedDocument
    DB-->>API: Return GeneratedDocument
    API-->>FE: Return document metadata
    FE->>API: GET /api/documents/download/{doc_id}
    API->>Storage: Get generated document
    Storage-->>API: Return DOCX file
    API-->>FE: Return DOCX file
    FE-->>Client: Download DOCX document